<div class="box">

    <h2>About Us</h2>

    <p>
        Welcome to GoalSeat (our CPIS-358 assignment). We created this website
        to help users browse football matches and request tickets in a simple
        and smooth manner.
    </p>

    <p>Our website allows users to:</p>

    <ul>
        <li>View available football matches and live scores</li>
        <li>Check ticket prices and categories</li>
        <li>Help users buy tickets in the easiest way possible</li>
        <li>Review match details clearly in one place</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Our goal is to provide a simple and clean interface that makes football
        ticket booking easier and more organized.
    </p>

    <br />

    <h3>Thank you for using GoalSeat!</h3>

